# Local reference material dropped in the tree, none of it ours to redistribute
# and all of it far too big for git. "RCA Technical docs.zip" is ~220 MB, which
# GitHub would reject outright (100 MB hard limit) -- it got swept into a commit
# once by a `git add -A` before this rule existed. Its unpacked form lives in
# docs/rca-technical/, ignored for the same reason: docs/ is tracked, so an
# unpacked archive in there is one careless `add -A` from being committed.
/*.zip
docs/rca-technical/
/dse
RCAStudioII.dse
dse_local_job_24632.log
out/

# tools/refemu is the vendored reference emulator (MIT) -- tracked on purpose,
# see its README. Only its build products are ignored.
tools/refemu/studio2_headless
tools/refemu/studio2
tools/refemu/*.o
tools/refemu/out/
/ignore
